@startuml
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam roundcorner 8

title Trade Store - Component & Architecture Diagram

node "Trade Store Service Container" {
    package "Presentation Layer (REST API)" {
        [FastAPI Application] as API
        [Exception Handlers] as Handlers
        [Pydantic Serialization] as Schema
    }

    package "Domain & Business Logic Layer" {
        [TradeService] as Service
        [TradeValidator] as Validator
        [TradeExpiryScheduler] as Scheduler
    }

    package "Persistence Layer" {
        [TradeRepository] as Repo
        [DatabaseManager] as DBManager
    }

    database "SQLite Storage\n(trade_store.db)" {
        [trades Table\nPK: (trade_id, version)] as TradesTable
        [Index: idx_trades_trade_id] as IdxTrade
        [Index: idx_trades_maturity] as IdxMaturity
    }
}

cloud "External Clients" {
    [REST Clients / Trading Feeds] as Client
}

cloud "CI/CD & DevOps Pipeline" {
    [GitHub Actions / Jenkins] as Pipeline
    [Regression Test Suite (unittest/pytest)] as Tests
    [pip-audit & Trivy Scanner] as Scanner
}

Client --> API : HTTP JSON /trades
API --> Service : Process trade
Service --> Validator : Validate version & maturity
Service --> Repo : Save / Fetch trades
Scheduler --> Service : Periodic expiry sync
Repo --> DBManager : SQL statements
DBManager --> TradesTable : ACID Transactions (WAL mode)

Pipeline --> Tests : Automated verification
Pipeline --> Scanner : Scan for Critical/Blocker CVEs
Pipeline ..> API : Deploy Container

@enduml
